{"id":"d2e92037fa533f9f","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-waring-problem.md","title":"Waring's Problem","display":"df-waring-problem — Waring's Problem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-waring-problem","aliases":["58-df-waring-problem"],"display":"df-waring-problem — Waring's Problem","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-waring-problem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-waring-problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-waring-problem — Waring's Problem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,k,s,g_\\infty\\in\\omega\">\\(N,k,s,g_\\infty\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WaringRepresentable}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{WaringRepresentable}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AsymptoticWaringNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AsymptoticWaringNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}waring\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\\mathrm{WaringRepresentable}_S(N,k,s)\\leftrightarrow k\\geq2\\land s\\geq1\\land\\exists a:s\\to\\omega\\;\\left(N=\\sum_{i\\in s}a(i)^k\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}waring\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\\mathrm{WaringRepresentable}_S(N,k,s)\\leftrightarrow k\\geq2\\land s\\geq1\\land\\exists a:s\\to\\omega\\;\\left(N=\\sum_{i\\in s}a(i)^k\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}waring\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\\mathrm{AsymptoticWaringNumber}_S(g_\\infty,k)\\leftrightarrow k\\geq2\\land g_\\infty=\\min\\{s\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}:\\exists N_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(N\\geq N_0\\to\\mathrm{WaringRepresentable}_S(N,k,s))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}waring\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\\mathrm{AsymptoticWaringNumber}_S(g_\\infty,k)\\leftrightarrow k\\geq2\\land g_\\infty=\\min\\{s\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}:\\exists N_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(N\\geq N_0\\to\\mathrm{WaringRepresentable}_S(N,k,s))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hilbert (1909): every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> is sum of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(k)\">\\(s(k)\\)</span> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-th powers.</li>\n<li>Initial exact values include <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(1)=1\">\\(g(1)=1\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(2)=4\">\\(g(2)=4\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(3)=9\">\\(g(3)=9\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(4)=19\">\\(g(4)=19\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(2) = 4\">\\(g(2) = 4\\)</span>: every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> is sum of 4 squares (Lagrange).</li>\n<li>The unique <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_\\infty\">\\(g_\\infty\\)</span> is denoted <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(k)\">\\(G(k)\\)</span>; Hilbert's theorem supplies existence.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(2)=4\">\\(G(2)=4\\)</span>; higher exponents require deep bounds, and no unsupported exact values are asserted here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"N,k,s,g_\\infty\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WaringRepresentable}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AsymptoticWaringNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}waring\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\\mathrm{WaringRepresentable}_S(N,k,s)\\leftrightarrow k\\geq2\\land s\\geq1\\land\\exists a:s\\to\\omega\\;\\left(N=\\sum_{i\\in s}a(i)^k\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}waring\\text{-}problem}\\vdash\\mathrm{AsymptoticWaringNumber}_S(g_\\infty,k)\\leftrightarrow k\\geq2\\land g_\\infty=\\min\\{s\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}:\\exists N_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(N\\geq N_0\\to\\mathrm{WaringRepresentable}_S(N,k,s))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"s(k)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"g(1)=1","display":false},{"tex":"g(2)=4","display":false},{"tex":"g(3)=9","display":false},{"tex":"g(4)=19","display":false},{"tex":"g(2) = 4","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"g_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"G(k)","display":false},{"tex":"G(2)=4","display":false}],"bytes":1259,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1373","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-waring-problem.md|58-df-waring-problem]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":[]}